[{"title":"前恩阳尉周邦举出予兄激仲所书其父竹轩记求诗因题二解 其一","author":"晁公溯","text":"眼看数竿今白头，高标直节气横秋。\n果能似此孤竹子，何羡渭川千亩侯。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":54728,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"前恩阳尉周邦举出予兄激仲所书其父竹轩记求诗因题二解 其二","author":"晁公溯","text":"俗士胸中数斛尘，此君偃蹇不相亲。\n当年曾识子猷面，大令今来是故人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":54729,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"春晚","author":"晁公溯","text":"花输落蕊归蜂室，风约疏帘纳燕泥。\n见此令人思故里，山门搔首忘东西。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":54730,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"眉州燕游杂咏十首 其五 披风榭","author":"晁公溯","text":"屏幛尽通彻，萧然尘土空。\n不畏赵盾日，知有楚王风。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":54731,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"眉州燕游杂咏十首 其三 临风阁","author":"晁公溯","text":"举扇谢风伯，排闼有清音。\n不可遣尘污，但当开我襟。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":54732,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"眉州燕游杂咏十首 其六 起文堂","author":"晁公溯","text":"天地有万籁，中存韶濩音。\n斯文未尝废，但见古犹今。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":54733,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"眉州燕游杂咏十首 其四 晚赋园","author":"晁公溯","text":"杂树略就列，清晨时涉园。\n逢幽付鼻咏，怀新劳目存。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":54734,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"眉州燕游杂咏十首 其七 野航","author":"晁公溯","text":"方床客常满，岂止两三人。\n谁可负之走，长留采白蘋。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":54735,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"眉州燕游杂咏十首 其二 葵亭","author":"晁公溯","text":"杲杲东出日，万方被照临。\n鸲鹆不踰济，草木有常心。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":54736,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"看花","author":"晁公溯","text":"春到人间得几时，可堪鹎鳷趣春归。\n不辞日去千回看，便恐风飘万点飞。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":54737,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"秋江","author":"晁公溯","text":"秋江水清不胜绿，还与汉江颜色同。\n望中白鸟忽飞去，落日丹枫相映红。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":54738,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"费子范以予铭其父墓持锦物相饷尽归之姑留洮州绿石研一作诗谢之 其二","author":"晁公溯","text":"讼牒装怀尘满胸，少无笔力老尤慵。\n洮州绿石堪为砺，聊与衰翁淬笔锋。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":54739,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"费子范以予铭其父墓持锦物相饷尽归之姑留洮州绿石研一作诗谢之 其一","author":"晁公溯","text":"大费家声星斗垂，乃翁名迹世人知。\n平生于此辞无愧，不减东京有道碑。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":54740,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送王师厚 其二","author":"晁公溯","text":"季父高名映里闾，复欣千里识名驹。\n当令东海评清誉，他日还如二大夫。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":54741,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送王师厚 其一","author":"晁公溯","text":"宿草丘边手自耘，辍耘过我意良勤。\n可怜一语未深接，借问去来何见闻。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":54742,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送张君玉赴宁江幕府七首 其七","author":"晁公溯","text":"江声汹汹雷霆硖，山气苍苍云雨台。\n白发拾遗吟不尽，分留物色待君来。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":54743,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送张君玉赴宁江幕府七首 其六","author":"晁公溯","text":"众水争流赴硖中，轻舟东下疾飞鸿。\n流金不信人间热，知有长江万里风。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":54744,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送张君玉赴宁江幕府七首 其五","author":"晁公溯","text":"远景楼高风月清，酒酣要看笔纵横。\n山川有待君知否，可是东坡赋不成。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":54745,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送张君玉赴宁江幕府七首 其四","author":"晁公溯","text":"来守剑西三里城，胸中岂止俗尘生。\n簿书堆案惟思睡，见此魁梧觉眼明。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":54746,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送张君玉赴宁江幕府七首 其三","author":"晁公溯","text":"子去夔州颇自矜，举杯大叫气凭陵。\n新诗硖内流传满，今有高人王右丞。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":54747,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送张君玉赴宁江幕府七首 其二","author":"晁公溯","text":"莫言地近巂昆明，刺史题书笔不停。\n解道澄江净如练，空濛山水是昭亭。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":54748,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送张君玉赴宁江幕府七首 其一","author":"晁公溯","text":"冠剑堂堂仁寿公，昨提金鼓去平戎。\n惜君不往分一矢，共射佛狸江水中。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":54749,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"夏夜","author":"晁公溯","text":"树阴高下绕周墙，静夜犹闻刻漏长。\n斗转未离天北极，参斜已近月西厢。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":54750,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"恭州报恩长老宣公以四偈见别用韵为谢 其四","author":"晁公溯","text":"海头已白藏头黑，老去心情总不堪。\n请唱德山歌一曲，却能打鼓似关南。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":54751,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"恭州报恩长老宣公以四偈见别用韵为谢 其二","author":"晁公溯","text":"甑中炊米釜烹鲜，莫道巴儿不解禅。\n日日扣门来乞火，个中已有一灯传。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":54752,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"恭州报恩长老宣公以四偈见别用韵为谢 其一","author":"晁公溯","text":"再到丛林得我惊，斩新花果自然成。\n种田更有僧祇户，乞食何如舍卫城。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":54753,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"恭州报恩长老宣公以四偈见别用韵为谢 其三","author":"晁公溯","text":"大地八风初不动，老夫自驾铁船行。\n莫忧船上不知晓，元有木鸡来报更。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":54754,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"病酒","author":"晁公溯","text":"遣愁自笑笔无功，醉觉花梢入眼红。\n本拟消磨付杯勺，不堪中酒过春风。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":54755,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"请缘老住持象耳山有诗次韵 其二","author":"晁公溯","text":"中岩尊者幸同堂，浪走诸方有底忙。\n若道渠侬棒可畏，新罗未过合思量。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":54756,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"请缘老住持象耳山有诗次韵 其一","author":"晁公溯","text":"朦胧两眼著玄花，认取空中起灭华。\n我是官曹老庞蕴，终无瞎棒与盲枷。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":54757,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"读江南诸公诗","author":"晁公溯","text":"吟尽江南草木春，只今台阁有诗人。\n汉廷安用沧浪句，容我持竿咏白蘋。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":54758,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偶成 其一","author":"晁公溯","text":"鸾鉴无尘月影圆，不须朱粉污红颜。\n待传京兆眉膴样，剩写春容入远山。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":54759,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偶成 其四","author":"晁公溯","text":"深深小閤夜笼香，日上珠帘逗晓光。\n为唤罗帷春睡起，翠盆添水试新妆。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":54760,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偶成 其二","author":"晁公溯","text":"脸上桃花春自开，眉边柳色日全回。\n遥知弄粉妆成晚，应待温郎玉镜台。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":54761,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偶成 其三","author":"晁公溯","text":"楼上东风帘幕垂，纤纤春笋弄妆迟。\n玉笼鹦鹉知人意，催报花梢日影移。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":54762,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偶题怀子兼弟","author":"晁公溯","text":"秋色丹枫畔，愁心白雁边。\n东来又相失，更拟待明年。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":54763,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"啖荔子戏作","author":"晁公溯","text":"已觉香皮腥染乾，渐忧熟颗鸟衔残。\n高攀上帝红云朵，笑撮仙人白玉丹。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":54764,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寄子兼弟时闻有平都之游","author":"晁公溯","text":"春风殿阁百花香，欲去题诗细作行。\n闻尔东游有佳句，只应先我赋灵光。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":54765,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"梦中作","author":"晁公溯","text":"举鞭重到故都行，予亦咨嗟恨不胜。\n心与陇云留汉苑，目随烟树绕秦陵。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":54766,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"登梁山县亭","author":"晁公溯","text":"举觞自起劝西风，吹尽千林木叶红。\n遮断前山浑不见，恐妨极目送飞鸿。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":54767,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"谢人惠生日诗二绝 其二","author":"晁公溯","text":"寿我新诗意甚勤，此难专享要平分。\n愿从蓟子摩铜狄，可谢苏公赠铁君。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":54768,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"谢人惠生日诗二绝 其一","author":"晁公溯","text":"本将豪句慰衰迟，开卷宁知起我悲。\n独对春风挥老泪，如闻人诵蓼莪诗。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":54769,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"感事","author":"晁公溯","text":"征衣消尽洛阳尘，泣向东风拭泪痕。\n不及青春归有信，一年一别乐游园。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":54770,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"感事三首 其三","author":"晁公溯","text":"常恐东南驿骑疏，每逢人至问扬都。\n深知白虏心轻汉，终倚黄旗运在吴。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":54771,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"感事三首 其二","author":"晁公溯","text":"长安摧堞有乌声，草木犹蒙战伐尘。\n应念关中不忘汉，至今遗老愿王秦。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":54772,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"感事三首 其一","author":"晁公溯","text":"中原耆旧老江东，泪洒军前草木风。\n巫峡山高苦霜雪，附书那有北来鸿。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":54773,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"溪上寻梅","author":"晁公溯","text":"冻雨霏霏不湿山，冰溪浅浅欲生澜。\n我来问讯无消息，笑倩东风与破寒。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":54774,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"照上人去硖内游吴下十年而归眉宇炯然无复泸濮间气喜作二解赠之 其一","author":"晁公溯","text":"几年持钵下瞿塘，踏遍东南古道场。\n乡里再来人不识，碧瞳白颊带湖光。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":54775,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"照上人去硖内游吴下十年而归眉宇炯然无复泸濮间气喜作二解赠之 其二","author":"晁公溯","text":"吴帆却入瞿塘硖，草树连云山四围。\n想见同来木上座，怪君何苦复东归。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":54776,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"遣愁","author":"晁公溯","text":"白尽汀蘋老，黄彫岸草秋。\n西风正萧瑟，何处不堪愁。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":54777,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"鲜于东之晋伯之子赠诗次韵 其二","author":"晁公溯","text":"堂上诗书抵万钟，席间樽俎是千峰。\n萧然更听松风曲，唤起江东阮仲容。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":54778,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"鲜于东之晋伯之子赠诗次韵 其一","author":"晁公溯","text":"微风猎树有佳声，一榻无尘户牖明。\n已擘荔枝怜玉破，更开瓜碧嚼冰清。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":54779,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"鲜于东之晋伯之子赠诗次韵 其四","author":"晁公溯","text":"尊前每诵赤壁赋，如见当年秃鬓翁。\n谁谓流传到乔木，果然遗响托悲风。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":54780,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"鲜于东之晋伯之子赠诗次韵 其六","author":"晁公溯","text":"资州太守知衰懒，日日倒床惟睡浓。\n走送甘鲜三百颗，似君风味喜相逢。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":54781,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"鲜于东之晋伯之子赠诗次韵 其五","author":"晁公溯","text":"一扫浮云万里空，月华都在野航中。\n葛巾藜杖勤相过，共赏芙蓉四面风。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":54782,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"赠张听声 其二","author":"晁公溯","text":"论士平生妙入神，是谁无此耳轮囷。\n唤钟作瓮皆堪笑，自是渠侬听不真。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":54783,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"赠张听声 其一","author":"晁公溯","text":"张子目盲心不盲，吾知胸次有人伦。\n眼光安用如岩电，白首王戎不识人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":54784,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"簿书","author":"晁公溯","text":"杨梢飞雪满城风，暖日催花烂熳红。\n诗兴消磨浑欲尽，一春心事簿书中。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":54785,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"九日","author":"晁公溯","text":"霜林木叶未全红，疏雨萧萧不满空。\n万里黄花欺病眼，十年乌帽怯秋风。\n可怜望远身能健，愈觉追欢岁不同。\n便欲题诗问乡国，不堪回首失飞鸿。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":54786,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"二十七叔父书来说东都故居如昔","author":"晁公溯","text":"吴蜀相望万里程，经年书到说都城。\n御沟犹泛宫花出，春草还依辇路生。\n京洛衣冠皆去国，东南父老亦伤情。\n郑公乡里闻如故，谁道胡儿解弛兵。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":54787,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"上都","author":"晁公溯","text":"晚岁辞荒塞，青春赴上都。\n望云君日近，犯斗客星孤。\n献纳看多士，衰迟失壮图。\n功名吾已懒，归拟著潜夫。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":54788,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"与客饮池上","author":"晁公溯","text":"脱略簿书外，按行池籞中。\n笋长风解碧，莲净雨攲红。\n佳客常契阔，良宵难会同。\n巾车幸过我，取别莫匆匆。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":54789,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"大冶县见梅","author":"晁公溯","text":"客里逢春色，江梅发故枝。\n正应伤老大，似欲慰栖迟。\n雪树真相引，风花莫倒吹。\n南来愧何逊，吾病不能诗。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":54790,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"小立","author":"晁公溯","text":"小立临洲渚，徐行过野亭。\n颓沙江沸白，穿径草分青。\n秩酒近无给，穷途真独醒。\n春来慰羁放，幽绝赖郊坰。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":54791,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"山行","author":"晁公溯","text":"白沙素石净无泥，橘刺藤梢已不迷。\n牛放远山连雁鹜，蛙鸣废沼下凫鹥。\n终年去国空弹铗，尽日看云且杖藜。\n久客诸侯成底事，幸逢宽政免推挤。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":54792,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"为邦","author":"晁公溯","text":"壤画东西剑，川分上下江。\n论才难塞职，逐食强为邦。\n晓起雨南亩，晚来风北窗。\n幽怀得陶写，赖有酒盈缸。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":54793,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"予己未十月二十有二日去涪上越明年八月二十有八日以事再来观山川之胜无异于昔而予之幽忧抑郁亦自若也","author":"晁公溯","text":"重来閒曳杖藜行，白帽依前似管宁。\n风雨只如当日恨，江山不改故时青。\n天寒未夕窗先暝，霜晚无声叶自零。\n诗罢时为洛生咏，醉吟聊使故人听。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":54794,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"六月八日雷雨大作喜呈张仲季孟","author":"晁公溯","text":"云雾相缠暝不开，披衣冲雨独登台。\n风号旷野吹江立，雷擘苍山震地来。\n从使郊原昏白昼，剩教草木洗黄埃。\n夜凉如此真堪饮，喜折圆荷作酒杯。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":54795,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"巴城","author":"晁公溯","text":"比从关塞历巴城，不复衣冠立汉庭。\n越巂江寒嗟独往，瞿塘硖险骇初经。\n双崖石立悬深翠，万岭排空送远青。\n久抗尘容驱俗驾，往来吾亦愧山灵。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":54796,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"方塘","author":"晁公溯","text":"清阴布幽径，绿水溢回塘。\n笋长露渍粉，莲开风坏妆。\n坐多惟踵息，躁定自心凉。\n学道今始得，颐生真有方。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":54797,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"止酒","author":"晁公溯","text":"卧病经旬不举觞，胸中无复少年狂。\n春心已逐飞花尽，午梦还随白日长。\n尘事无穷那可了，诗情常在不能忘。\n闭门觅句无馀事，书策纷纷正绕床。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":54798,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"王才谅归自临安备道群从内集之乐感而有作","author":"晁公溯","text":"岂料高阳里，于今复旧游。\n风尘两地隔，江海一身留。\n梦断乌衣夜，魂伤白帝秋。\n临平江上柳，早晚系归舟。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":54799,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"王元才甥见过其弟元济甥继来有诗次韵","author":"晁公溯","text":"把酒悲歌望蜀天，感今怀昔重悽然。\n道坚或谓如无忌，灵运还欣对阿连。\n他日鹏应自鹍化，此生蚿岂待夔怜。\n笔锋剩淬犹锥利，明岁文场破两甄。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":54800,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"王伯厚以诗招伯浑次韵同往邀之","author":"晁公溯","text":"忆昨归来万里遥，不能对策未央朝。\n山林得计成长往，松石为朋是久要。\n痛饮肯来同榼挈，小诗聊遣当弓招。\n请君莫学全椒老，涧下辛勤舍堕樵。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":54801,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}}]